    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;A tall man with a black hat wanders across desolated worlds, stumbling beneath the endless stars.&quot;</strong><br><br>A mysterious wanderer with bright eyes and a tall, black hat traverses these forgotten lands, unraveling their stories and cleansing their darkness.<br><br>Control strange white weapons and flames to destroy barbed black structures. Discover relics and scant remnants of vanished civilizations.<br><br>Uncover a hidden power within your heart. Walk through many worlds, and between them, as ancient imprisoned souls fiercely cling to their own brittle existence. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore Over 100 Visually Unique Worlds </li><li>Intriguing Narrative\u00a0with Mysterious Secrets </li><li>Dynamic Progression </li><li>Thematic Music and Ambience  </li><li>Collect Hundreds of Items and Learn Their Stories <br><br><br><br><strong>&quot;He will find us.&quot;</strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;A tall man with a black hat wanders across desolated worlds, stumbling beneath the endless stars.&quot;</strong><br><br>A mysterious wanderer with bright eyes and a tall, black hat traverses these forgotten lands, unraveling their stories and cleansing their darkness.<br><br>Control strange white weapons and flames to destroy barbed black structures. Discover relics and scant remnants of vanished civilizations.<br><br>Uncover a hidden power within your heart. Walk through many worlds, and between them, as ancient imprisoned souls fiercely cling to their own brittle existence. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore Over 100 Visually Unique Worlds </li><li>Intriguing Narrative\u00a0with Mysterious Secrets </li><li>Dynamic Progression </li><li>Thematic Music and Ambience  </li><li>Collect Hundreds of Items and Learn Their Stories <br><br><br><br><strong>&quot;He will find us.&quot;</strong></li></ul>",
